<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家からの外.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Nasty wind...! It's like a typhoon."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Lieutenant<STYLE ID="1">, there's been no scheduled check-in from the unit posted around the Kogori home!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What!? Damn it, did they show up over there!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But could they really go out of contact without any warning at all...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">We contacted them from our end too, but there's no answer."</STYLE><PG>
"You're right, that is strange... 
{PAUSE ""}
If anything at all seemed off, they'd try to contact us. 
{PAUSE ""}
If they haven't even done that... 
{PAUSE ""}
All right, send just two from our unit to check around the Kogori home. 
{PAUSE ""}
Everyone else keeps watching the Goto home."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Understood!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"So you finally showed your face, <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE>...!"
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
